📁 AI Models — Reflexhon Global
This folder contains all AI model assets used by Reflexhon Global, including weights, configuration files, adapters, or Hugging Face-ready exports.
Structure
ai/models/         → Model files, config, weights  
ai/spaces/         → Hugging Face Spaces apps (UI demos)
ai/datasets/       → Datasets used to train or align Reflexhon AI
Purpose

Store exported models

Store fine-tuning adapters (LoRA, PEFT, etc.)

Maintain model cards for Hugging Face

Track model versions used by Reflexhon Creator Studio

Notes

Do not push large weights directly (use HF repo or LFS)

Add a model-card.md for each model

Keep versions semantic: v0.1, v0.2, etc.

# 🤖 Reflexhon AI — Core Directory

E direktorio aki ta kontené tur e modulenan relashoná ku AI den Reflexhon Global.

## 📌 Subfolders
- `ai/models/` — Model cards, weights (HF-hosted), config
- `ai/datasets/` — Dataset dokumentashon, JSONL, preprocessing
- `ai/spaces/` — Hugging Face Spaces demos for models / tools

## 🧩 Meta
Organisa AI assets den un forma modular ku por eksportá pa:
- Hugging Face Models
- Reflexhon Creator Studio
- Reflexhon Mesh (2026)

## ⚠️ Note
No pusha **model weights > 50MB** na GitHub.

